{"id":"n13965-1-9","stage":2,"title":"시선 · 视线","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n13965-1-9-1","ko":"어떻게 내가 널 보고 있는지 알았니?","zh":"你怎么知道我在看你？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"널","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"널","audio":"/audio/97a247feda03942fab7e.mp3"}},{"text":"보고","meaning":"对着","explanation":"보다：对着；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"23","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고","audio":"/audio/ddf2aaf35f3c5a087464.mp3"}},{"text":"있는지","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는지","audio":"/audio/7df109195b78bcf9f45d.mp3"}},{"text":"알았니?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았니","audio":"/audio/e0ab5644825d6f9c5e3c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"对着","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"以某人为对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0ff131be5a6fdb858fa1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n13965-1-9-2","ko":"네 시선이 느껴졌어.","zh":"我感觉到了你的目光。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"시선이","meaning":"视线","explanation":"시선：视线；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시선","audio":"/audio/e13568f722a5e0b607d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13965","senseId":"1","lemma":"시선","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시선이","audio":"/audio/bf05ce566e2aca64dea9.mp3"}},{"text":"느껴졌어.","meaning":"感受到，意识到，意识到；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"느끼다：感受到，意识到，意识到；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64376","senseId":"3","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느껴졌어","audio":"/audio/31af979fa652db359c9f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"e13568f722a5e0b6","term":"시선","zh":"视线","audio":"/audio/e13568f722a5e0b607d4.mp3","entryId":"13965","definition":"望向某个方向的眼睛。","pronunciation":["시선"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"感受到，意识到，意识到","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"64376","definition":"内心感悟到某种事实。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3323f95b467cc5a66419.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.438,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=13965","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":74,"sequenceScore":2.0356,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我感觉到了你的目光。","你怎么知道我在看你？","做面包的时候，哪种材料用得最多呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你怎么知道我在看你？","做面包的时候，哪种材料用得最多呢？","我感觉到了你的目光。"],"answer":2}]}
